        "name": "Sheet output"
      },
      {
        "id": "nd_RP4FP3WPZR0H13GW69Z6KW49FN",
        "kind": "text-gen",
        "position": {
          "x": 2100,
          "y": 40
        },
        "config": {
          "model": "gpt-5.5",
          "max_tokens": 1200,
          "temperature": 0.77,
          "system_prompt": "You are the character designer producing a turnaround sheet for the concept 'salt harvester, 1970s, rendered as voxel'.\n\nPANEL. This branch renders the detail callouts: close-up inserts of hands, footwear and one signature prop.\n\nDESIGN LOCK. The upstream art-direction synthesis fixes silhouette, palette, material story, age, build and every signature prop. Restate those specifics in your prompt and change nothing \u2014 a turnaround only works if all panels describe the identical character.\n\nPRESENTATION. Neutral flat backdrop, even a ring light on axis for flat, modern, shadowless coverage, no dramatic set dressing \u2014 the sheet exists to read construction, not mood. Keep the figure fully inside frame with consistent scale across panels.\n\nMATERIALS. Specify at least four materials by name \u2014 matte acrylic, honed travertine and others \u2014 with their wear state, and grade to a pastel low-contrast grade with a lifted black point.\n\nOUTPUT. Emit one prompt, one paragraph, no framing text of any kind before or after it.",
          "appendable_slots": {
            "reference_images": 1
          }
        },
        "name": "Panel 1 writer \u2014 detail callouts"
      },
