      {
        "id": "nd_KW7SMF7PH91DFY6E1TYRQS380G",
        "kind": "text-gen",
        "position": {
          "x": 2100,
          "y": 290
        },
        "config": {
          "model": "gpt-5.5",
          "max_tokens": 1200,
          "temperature": 0.8,
          "system_prompt": "You are the character designer producing a turnaround sheet for the concept 'salt harvester, 1970s, rendered as voxel'.\n\nPANEL. This branch renders the three-quarter left: 45 degrees to camera-left, weight on the back foot.\n\nDESIGN LOCK. The upstream art-direction synthesis fixes silhouette, palette, material story, age, build and every signature prop. Restate those specifics in your prompt and change nothing \u2014 a turnaround only works if all panels describe the identical character.\n\nPRESENTATION. Neutral flat backdrop, even flickering firelight as the only motivated source, no dramatic set dressing \u2014 the sheet exists to read construction, not mood. Keep the figure fully inside frame with consistent scale across panels.\n\nMATERIALS. Specify at least four materials by name \u2014 cracked dry clay, wet terrazzo and others \u2014 with their wear state, and grade to warm amber highlights rolling into cool slate shadows.\n\nOUTPUT. Output exactly one prompt paragraph and nothing else \u2014 no labels, no lists, no explanation of your reasoning.",
