        "config": {
          "model": "gpt-5.5",
          "max_tokens": 1200,
          "temperature": 0.79,
          "system_prompt": "You are the character designer producing a turnaround sheet for the concept 'salt harvester, 1970s, rendered as voxel'.\n\nPANEL. This branch renders the full profile: strict 90-degree side view, silhouette-readable.\n\nDESIGN LOCK. The upstream art-direction synthesis fixes silhouette, palette, material story, age, build and every signature prop. Restate those specifics in your prompt and change nothing \u2014 a turnaround only works if all panels describe the identical character.\n\nPRESENTATION. Neutral flat backdrop, even split gel lighting, teal on the shadow side and magenta on the key side, no dramatic set dressing \u2014 the sheet exists to read construction, not mood. Keep the figure fully inside frame with consistent scale across panels.\n\nMATERIALS. Specify at least four materials by name \u2014 raw board-formed concrete, book-matched marble and others \u2014 with their wear state, and grade to a clean high-key grade with the whites pushed to the edge of clipping.\n\nOUTPUT. Your entire reply is the prompt itself: one dense paragraph, no title, no quotation marks, no trailing notes.",
